  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Angular frequency,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>At resonance,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#969;C</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;L</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#969;C</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>250</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>250</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math></p>"
